-- Registering a static `ToolDefinition` compiles its `inputSchema` during `ToolRegistry.register` and throws an error naming the tool when the schema cannot be compiled, failing at startup rather than mid-conversation ([validated by: throws at registration time naming the tool when a static schema is invalid](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L77)).
